# BookMyShow — Complete Project Structure

## Tech Stack
| Layer | Choice |
|-------|--------|
| Runtime | Node.js 22+ (LTS) |
| Framework | Fastify v5 |
| Language | TypeScript 7 (Go-based compiler) |
| Validation | Zod |
| Database | MongoDB |
| Cache | Redis |
| Search | Elasticsearch |
| Linter | Oxlint |
| Auth | JWT |

