## Data Flow per Request

```
HTTP Request
    │
    ▼
routes.ts (Fastify handler)
    │  validates via Zod schema
    ▼
service.ts (business logic)
    │  checks cache first
    ▼
cache.ts ──── HIT ──▶ return cached data
    │
   MISS
    │
    ▼
repository.ts (data access)
    │  queries MongoDB / in-memory
    ▼
service.ts (format response)
    │  sets cache
    ▼
HTTP Response (via shared/types.ts ApiResponse<T>)
```

