## API Endpoints (Phase 1)

| Method | Endpoint | Module |
|--------|----------|--------|
| GET | `/health` | bootstrap |
| GET | `/api/v1/cities` | cities |
| GET | `/api/v1/cities/:id` | cities |
| GET | `/api/v1/cities/:cityId/cinemas` | cinemas |
| GET | `/api/v1/cinemas/:id` | cinemas |
| GET | `/api/v1/cinemas/:cinemaId/shows` | shows |
| GET | `/api/v1/shows/:id` | shows |

